PARSFILE
#FullDataName I/O Channels: Write`Copy Vx and Station to CSV`
#CheckBox1 1    

#RingCtrl1 1
#RingCtrl2 0
#RingCtrl3 1
#RingCtrl4 0

#MiscYellow0
#Station
#VxTarget
