OPT_AUXOUT_MAT 0
OPT_AUXOUT_ALL_WRITE_CSV 0
WRT_Station
WRTAUX Station
WRT_VxTarget
WRTAUX VxTarget

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This dataset is set up to save 2 channels of output variables in .CSV (Excel).
#
#The results are to be pasted into a dataset for a target speed vs. station to be used for moving objects representing a tractor-semitrailer.
#
#Besides setting up the creation of the CSV file, this dataset overrides the accleration limits for the path preview speed controller with lower values that might be representative of a heavy truck.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

